{"meta":{"id":"generic","category":"it/syntax/python/function","title":"제네릭 (TypeVar) · Python","subtitle":"(PYTHON)","summary":"def f[T] / class Box[T] (3.12+), TypeVar · Generic, bound 제약","tags":["python","f-generic"],"color":"amber","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-amber","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-amber-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-amber-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></span>PYTHON</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">제네릭 (TypeVar) · Python</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> def f[T] / class Box[T] (3.12+), TypeVar · Generic, bound 제약</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">제네릭</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">python</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\"># Python 3.12+\r\ndef first[T](items: list[T]) -&gt; T | None:\r\n    return items[0] if items else None\r\n\r\nclass Box[T]:\r\n    def __init__(self, value: T) -&gt; None:\r\n        self.value = value\r\n\r\n# 이전 버전\r\nfrom typing import TypeVar, Generic\r\nT = TypeVar(&quot;T&quot;, bound=&quot;Comparable&quot;)   # bound = extends 제약\r\nclass Box2(Generic[T]): ...</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">제네릭도 타입 힌트 — 실행 중에는 아무것도 막지 않는다</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › 제네릭, Java › 제네릭</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/python/function/generic","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"python","title":"PYTHON","path":"it/syntax/python"},{"id":"function","title":"함수","path":"it/syntax/python/function"}],"hasImage":false}